source: crates/telec-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: output
---
Atomically update a live todo's metadata, dependencies, kind, and/or content

Usage: telec-cli workflow todo update [OPTIONS] <SLUG> [CONTENT]

Arguments:
  <SLUG>     Todo slug (unique per project)
  [CONTENT]  Optional inline content to write as a new artifact version

Options:
      --artifact <ARTIFACT>        Artifact kind for positional content. Defaults to `input`
      --project <PROJECT>          Override the project context. By default the project name is derived from the current working directory's basename
      --after <AFTER>              Dependency slugs. Replaces the existing dependency set in full
      --group <GROUP>              New visual grouping label
      --description <DESCRIPTION>  New free-form description
      --kind <KIND>                New work item kind
      --prepped                    Write content as `implementation-plan` with the prepped HITL guard
  -h, --help                       Print help
